{"real": true, "dur": 97.42, "sent": [{"start": 0.22, "end": 2.6, "text": "Now for step two, the settings.", "words": [{"w": "Now", "s": 0.22}, {"w": "for", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "step", "s": 0.98}, {"w": "two,", "s": 1.26}, {"w": "the", "s": 1.9}, {"w": "settings.", "s": 2.04}]}, {"start": 3.5, "end": 6.56, "text": "This is where French and Chinese start to look quite different.", "words": [{"w": "This", "s": 3.5}, {"w": "is", "s": 3.68}, {"w": "where", "s": 3.88}, {"w": "French", "s": 4.16}, {"w": "and", "s": 4.54}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 4.72}, {"w": "start", "s": 5.18}, {"w": "to", "s": 5.42}, {"w": "look", "s": 5.54}, {"w": "quite", "s": 5.76}, {"w": "different.", "s": 6.1}]}, {"start": 7.44, "end": 13.42, "text": "Here’s the idea: I can keep the same exercise, but change what learners have to choose.", "words": [{"w": "Here’s", "s": 7.44}, {"w": "the", "s": 7.68}, {"w": "idea:", "s": 7.86}, {"w": "I", "s": 9.16}, {"w": "can", "s": 9.26}, {"w": "keep", "s": 9.48}, {"w": "the", "s": 9.68}, {"w": "same", "s": 9.8}, {"w": "exercise,", "s": 10.08}, {"w": "but", "s": 11.22}, {"w": "change", "s": 11.46}, {"w": "what", "s": 11.98}, {"w": "learners", "s": 12.22}, {"w": "have", "s": 12.66}, {"w": "to", "s": 12.88}, {"w": "choose.", "s": 13.04}]}, {"start": 13.96, "end": 19.54, "text": "In French, for example, at two stars, the key choice is the article.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 13.96}, {"w": "French,", "s": 14.18}, {"w": "for", "s": 14.94}, {"w": "example,", "s": 15.06}, {"w": "at", "s": 15.98}, {"w": "two", "s": 16.18}, {"w": "stars,", "s": 16.44}, {"w": "the", "s": 17.52}, {"w": "key", "s": 17.7}, {"w": "choice", "s": 17.94}, {"w": "is", "s": 18.66}, {"w": "the", "s": 18.88}, {"w": "article.", "s": 19.08}]}, {"start": 20.36, "end": 27.58, "text": "You like yoga, so it takes “the.” But you do yoga, so it takes “some.” Look at the two sentences here.", "words": [{"w": "You", "s": 20.36}, {"w": "like", "s": 20.5}, {"w": "yoga,", "s": 20.78}, {"w": "so", "s": 21.62}, {"w": "it", "s": 21.76}, {"w": "takes", "s": 21.9}, {"w": "“the.”", "s": 22.2}, {"w": "But", "s": 23.22}, {"w": "you", "s": 23.44}, {"w": "do", "s": 23.58}, {"w": "yoga,", "s": 23.8}, {"w": "so", "s": 24.56}, {"w": "it", "s": 24.7}, {"w": "takes", "s": 24.84}, {"w": "“some.”", "s": 25.1}, {"w": "Look", "s": 26.12}, {"w": "at", "s": 26.28}, {"w": "the", "s": 26.38}, {"w": "two", "s": 26.54}, {"w": "sentences", "s": 26.74}, {"w": "here.", "s": 27.32}]}, {"start": 27.58, "end": 34.42, "text": "“The” versus “some” is exactly where beginners go wrong, so that’s the gap the learner has to fill.", "words": [{"w": "“The”", "s": 27.58}, {"w": "versus", "s": 28.78}, {"w": "“some”", "s": 29.12}, {"w": "is", "s": 29.96}, {"w": "exactly", "s": 30.18}, {"w": "where", "s": 30.72}, {"w": "beginners", "s": 30.96}, {"w": "go", "s": 31.46}, {"w": "wrong,", "s": 31.6}, {"w": "so", "s": 32.34}, {"w": "that’s", "s": 32.58}, {"w": "the", "s": 32.84}, {"w": "gap", "s": 33.04}, {"w": "the", "s": 33.34}, {"w": "learner", "s": 33.5}, {"w": "has", "s": 33.82}, {"w": "to", "s": 34.02}, {"w": "fill.", "s": 34.16}]}, {"start": 35.28, "end": 38.1, "text": "Mandarin, however, has no articles.", "words": [{"w": "Mandarin,", "s": 35.28}, {"w": "however,", "s": 36.18}, {"w": "has", "s": 37.02}, {"w": "no", "s": 37.28}, {"w": "articles.", "s": 37.5}]}, {"start": 38.72, "end": 40.08, "text": "So what goes in the gap?", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 38.72}, {"w": "what", "s": 38.98}, {"w": "goes", "s": 39.24}, {"w": "in", "s": 39.56}, {"w": "the", "s": 39.68}, {"w": "gap?", "s": 39.82}]}, {"start": 40.54, "end": 44.22, "text": "In this example, it’s the verb that goes with the object.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 40.54}, {"w": "this", "s": 40.72}, {"w": "example,", "s": 40.96}, {"w": "it’s", "s": 42.0}, {"w": "the", "s": 42.22}, {"w": "verb", "s": 42.4}, {"w": "that", "s": 42.76}, {"w": "goes", "s": 43.0}, {"w": "with", "s": 43.36}, {"w": "the", "s": 43.6}, {"w": "object.", "s": 43.74}]}, {"start": 45.24, "end": 47.26, "text": "These all come from the first textbook.", "words": [{"w": "These", "s": 45.24}, {"w": "all", "s": 45.6}, {"w": "come", "s": 45.84}, {"w": "from", "s": 46.08}, {"w": "the", "s": 46.26}, {"w": "first", "s": 46.42}, {"w": "textbook.", "s": 46.74}]}, {"start": 48.04, "end": 53.66, "text": "Look at these three examples: play ball, see a film, drink coffee.", "words": [{"w": "Look", "s": 48.04}, {"w": "at", "s": 48.22}, {"w": "these", "s": 48.42}, {"w": "three", "s": 48.82}, {"w": "examples:", "s": 49.08}, {"w": "play", "s": 50.36}, {"w": "ball,", "s": 50.62}, {"w": "see", "s": 51.58}, {"w": "a", "s": 51.78}, {"w": "film,", "s": 51.92}, {"w": "drink", "s": 52.78}, {"w": "coffee.", "s": 53.24}]}, {"start": 54.22, "end": 57.5, "text": "So the learner matches each verb to its object.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 54.22}, {"w": "the", "s": 54.5}, {"w": "learner", "s": 54.64}, {"w": "matches", "s": 55.26}, {"w": "each", "s": 55.82}, {"w": "verb", "s": 56.1}, {"w": "to", "s": 56.6}, {"w": "its", "s": 56.76}, {"w": "object.", "s": 57.02}]}, {"start": 58.5, "end": 60.92, "text": "Another good example is the measure word.", "words": [{"w": "Another", "s": 58.5}, {"w": "good", "s": 58.9}, {"w": "example", "s": 59.08}, {"w": "is", "s": 59.88}, {"w": "the", "s": 60.1}, {"w": "measure", "s": 60.26}, {"w": "word.", "s": 60.68}]}, {"start": 61.86, "end": 66.42, "text": "For instance, a piece of clothing takes the classifier you see here.", "words": [{"w": "For", "s": 61.86}, {"w": "instance,", "s": 62.06}, {"w": "a", "s": 63.16}, {"w": "piece", "s": 63.3}, {"w": "of", "s": 63.58}, {"w": "clothing", "s": 63.76}, {"w": "takes", "s": 64.4}, {"w": "the", "s": 64.62}, {"w": "classifier", "s": 64.76}, {"w": "you", "s": 65.6}, {"w": "see", "s": 65.84}, {"w": "here.", "s": 66.14}]}, {"start": 66.86, "end": 70.98, "text": "But the typical beginner mistake is to use the general-purpose one.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 66.86}, {"w": "the", "s": 67.02}, {"w": "typical", "s": 67.22}, {"w": "beginner", "s": 67.82}, {"w": "mistake", "s": 68.28}, {"w": "is", "s": 69.0}, {"w": "to", "s": 69.14}, {"w": "use", "s": 69.42}, {"w": "the", "s": 69.66}, {"w": "general-purpose", "s": 69.88}, {"w": "one.", "s": 70.78}]}, {"start": 71.78, "end": 77.32, "text": "So I can reuse the same exercise format, but change the answer depending on the language.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 71.78}, {"w": "I", "s": 72.02}, {"w": "can", "s": 72.12}, {"w": "reuse", "s": 72.32}, {"w": "the", "s": 72.8}, {"w": "same", "s": 73.02}, {"w": "exercise", "s": 73.4}, {"w": "format,", "s": 73.96}, {"w": "but", "s": 74.84}, {"w": "change", "s": 75.06}, {"w": "the", "s": 75.42}, {"w": "answer", "s": 75.6}, {"w": "depending", "s": 76.1}, {"w": "on", "s": 76.58}, {"w": "the", "s": 76.72}, {"w": "language.", "s": 76.82}]}, {"start": 78.18, "end": 82.52, "text": "In French, “some” fits and “the” bounces off.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 78.18}, {"w": "French,", "s": 78.36}, {"w": "“some”", "s": 78.78}, {"w": "fits", "s": 79.82}, {"w": "and", "s": 80.66}, {"w": "“the”", "s": 80.8}, {"w": "bounces", "s": 81.66}, {"w": "off.", "s": 82.28}]}, {"start": 82.98, "end": 89.32, "text": "In Chinese, in the same way, the classifier for clothing fits, and the general one bounces off.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 82.98}, {"w": "Chinese,", "s": 83.16}, {"w": "in", "s": 84.0}, {"w": "the", "s": 84.08}, {"w": "same", "s": 84.24}, {"w": "way,", "s": 84.48}, {"w": "the", "s": 85.18}, {"w": "classifier", "s": 85.32}, {"w": "for", "s": 86.08}, {"w": "clothing", "s": 86.26}, {"w": "fits,", "s": 86.7}, {"w": "and", "s": 87.52}, {"w": "the", "s": 87.66}, {"w": "general", "s": 87.82}, {"w": "one", "s": 88.26}, {"w": "bounces", "s": 88.66}, {"w": "off.", "s": 89.1}]}, {"start": 89.76, "end": 96.88, "text": "Beyond that, Chinese also needs exercises for tones and characters, but these still fit into the same categories.", "words": [{"w": "Beyond", "s": 89.76}, {"w": "that,", "s": 90.16}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 90.8}, {"w": "also", "s": 91.28}, {"w": "needs", "s": 91.56}, {"w": "exercises", "s": 91.92}, {"w": "for", "s": 92.68}, {"w": "tones", "s": 92.88}, {"w": "and", "s": 93.36}, {"w": "characters,", "s": 93.54}, {"w": "but", "s": 94.56}, {"w": "these", "s": 94.76}, {"w": "still", "s": 95.02}, {"w": "fit", "s": 95.28}, {"w": "into", "s": 95.5}, {"w": "the", "s": 95.74}, {"w": "same", "s": 95.9}, {"w": "categories.", "s": 96.2}]}]}